\ holes.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 7
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch07/holes.8th
\
\ Sometimes a save/restore urge is a sign of bad factoring, not a
\ problem to solve with more machinery. holes doesn't touch the
\ "current game length" global at all -- only game does -- so there's
\ nothing to save or restore in the first place.

: play-hole  \ index --
  "playing hole " . . cr ;

locals:
: holes  \ n --
  "n" w:!
  ' play-hole  0  "n" w:@ n:1-  loop ;

0 var, #holes
: long   18 #holes ! ;
: short  9 #holes ! ;
: game   #holes @ holes ;

short
game

bye
